31.\"}\n{\"scenario\":31,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"The Commerce Department formally decided against the proposed escalation, and no restriction took effect.\"}\n{\"scenario\":32,\"rung\":1,\"why\":\"The Bureau of Industry and Security put into effect a binding export-licensing rule beyond its May 2026 guidance.\"}\n{\"scenario\":33,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"The Commerce Department formally withdrew the proposed escalation, and no restriction took effect.\"}\n{\"scenario\":34,\"rung\":1,\"why\":\"Chinese authorities approved imports of Nvidia H200 chips into China.\"}\n{\"scenario\":35,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"Chinese authorities formally decided against permitting H200 imports, and that position stands on the due day.\"}\n{\"scenario\":36,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"Chinese authorities formally decided against permitting H200 imports, and that position stands on the due day.\"}"}}
